stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Automatic
  state "Next automatic read loads all Home data" as Automatic
  state "Next read updates calendar only" as Agenda
  state "Full Home refresh waiting" as Full
  Automatic --> Agenda: Review decision succeeds
  Automatic --> Full: Click Refresh Home
  Agenda --> Agenda: Another review decision succeeds
  Agenda --> Full: Click Refresh Home
  Full --> Full: Another review decision succeeds
  Full --> Full: Click Refresh Home again
  Automatic --> Automatic: Start full read
  Agenda --> Automatic: Start calendar read
  Full --> Automatic: Start full read
  %% A waiting full Home refresh must not become a calendar-only read.
  %% test/home-read-queue.test.mjs exercises the request pairs and each consume edge.
  %% test/deal-update-reviews-browser.test.mjs drives the held agenda, full request,
  %% later decision and actual full read in the running app.
  %% In-flight reads, timeout and disposal belong to the existing auto-refresh lifecycle.
